{"id":"train-01","split":"train","rights":"created-for-this-tutorial","text":"小猫看月亮。小猫喜欢安静的夜晚。"}
{"id":"train-02","split":"train","rights":"created-for-this-tutorial","text":"小狗看星星。小狗喜欢明亮的夜晚。"}
{"id":"train-03","split":"train","rights":"created-for-this-tutorial","text":"小鸟看天空。小鸟喜欢温暖的早晨。"}
{"id":"train-04","split":"train","rights":"created-for-this-tutorial","text":"学生读故事。学生在安静的房间学习。"}
{"id":"train-05","split":"train","rights":"created-for-this-tutorial","text":"老师写句子。老师在明亮的教室讲课。"}
{"id":"train-06","split":"train","rights":"created-for-this-tutorial","text":"月亮照亮小路。星星照亮夜晚的天空。"}
{"id":"train-07","split":"train","rights":"created-for-this-tutorial","text":"早晨有温暖的阳光。学生走过明亮的小路。"}
{"id":"train-08","split":"train","rights":"created-for-this-tutorial","text":"夜晚有安静的月光。小猫走过安静的小路。"}
{"id":"train-09","split":"train","rights":"created-for-this-tutorial","text":"我们用句子记录故事。我们用故事学习语言。"}
{"id":"train-10","split":"train","rights":"created-for-this-tutorial","text":"语言模型读句子。语言模型学习预测下一个字。"}
{"id":"train-11","split":"train","rights":"created-for-this-tutorial","text":"数据来自固定的小故事。训练只使用训练集数据。"}
{"id":"train-12","split":"train","rights":"created-for-this-tutorial","text":"验证集检查模型的损失。测试集留到训练结束后。"}
{"id":"train-13","split":"train","rights":"created-for-this-tutorial","text":"固定随机种子帮助复现实验。完整检查点帮助恢复训练。"}
{"id":"train-14","split":"train","rights":"created-for-this-tutorial","text":"注意力只能看当前和过去。模型不能看见未来的字。"}
{"id":"train-15","split":"train","rights":"created-for-this-tutorial","text":"词表只从训练集建立。未知字使用未知标记。"}
{"id":"train-16","split":"train","rights":"created-for-this-tutorial","text":"小模型适合学习流程。小模型不是生产系统。"}
{"id":"dev-01","split":"dev","rights":"created-for-this-tutorial","text":"小猫在明亮的早晨读故事。"}
{"id":"dev-02","split":"dev","rights":"created-for-this-tutorial","text":"学生在安静的夜晚看星星。"}
{"id":"dev-03","split":"dev","rights":"created-for-this-tutorial","text":"模型用训练集学习预测字。"}
{"id":"dev-04","split":"dev","rights":"created-for-this-tutorial","text":"固定种子和检查点帮助恢复。"}
{"id":"test-01","split":"test","rights":"created-for-this-tutorial","text":"小狗在温暖的早晨走过小路。"}
{"id":"test-02","split":"test","rights":"created-for-this-tutorial","text":"老师用句子讲明语言模型。"}
{"id":"test-03","split":"test","rights":"created-for-this-tutorial","text":"测试集只在训练结束后检查。"}
{"id":"test-04","split":"test","rights":"created-for-this-tutorial","text":"注意力不能看见未来。"}
